    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Nostalgic Blast of Retro Adventure Gaming!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back in time to the year 1990 with <strong>MIGHTY 1990</strong>, a game that feels like it was plucked straight from the late '80s and early '90s, but with just the right touch of modern polish. Combining the best elements of <strong>text-based adventures</strong>, <strong>point-and-click mechanics</strong>, and a sprinkle of <strong>RPG charm</strong>, this humorous and nostalgic journey will tickle your brain and your funny bone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452050/extras/3559b8c7b6d64baddc4de5c42f478c22.poster.avif?t=1749483535\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452050/extras/3559b8c7b6d64baddc4de5c42f478c22.webm?t=1749483535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452050/extras/3559b8c7b6d64baddc4de5c42f478c22.mp4?t=1749483535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as we know it is on the brink of catastrophe\u2014but <strong>the first domino that set everything in motion fell back in 1990</strong>. Now, you\u2019ve been thrown back in time to <strong>change history and prevent the events that led to today\u2019s downfall</strong>. As an unlikely hero navigating a world of absurd characters, bizarre puzzles, and nostalgic charm, you'll need to outsmart obstacles, <strong>roll the dice in crucial moments</strong>, and make choices that will determine the future. The fate of <strong>humanity, the universe, and even moccasins</strong> rests in your hands\u2026 or rather, your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452050/extras/2f2591b8c9718d8d05edf683fb6f3634.poster.avif?t=1749483535\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452050/extras/2f2591b8c9718d8d05edf683fb6f3634.webp?t=1749483535\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Gameplay Mechanics</strong>: Every action is mapped to your keyboard! Push L + 2 to \u201cLook at Posters\u201d or G + 1 to \u201cGo To the Hallway.\u201d No clicking required!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel-Perfect Visuals</strong>: Rigid pixel-art resolution (426x240) with a charming 16-color palette, toon-style characters, and laugh-out-loud animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Outcomes</strong>: Choose your class, develop your skills, and roll the dice to sway outcomes. High charisma? Convince NPCs with a smile. Poor roll? Time to think outside the box!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Endings</strong>: Your decisions, class, and skills shape the narrative and lead to a variety of satisfying (or hilariously tragic) conclusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Nostalgia</strong>: Lovingly crafted to emulate the humor, quirks, and aesthetics of classic adventure games with a fresh twist.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the joy of solving puzzles, exploring pixelated worlds, and laughing at cheesy yet endearing dialogue? <strong>MIGHTY 1990</strong> delivers all that and more in a tightly packed, keyboard-friendly package. Perfect for gamers who grew up on retro adventures\u2014or those looking to experience what they missed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Today!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to relive the golden age of adventure gaming. <strong>MIGHTY 1990</strong> promises an unforgettable, humor-filled journey that you\u2019ll want to share with friends!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Nostalgic Blast of Retro Adventure Gaming!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back in time to the year 1990 with <strong>MIGHTY 1990</strong>, a game that feels like it was plucked straight from the late '80s and early '90s, but with just the right touch of modern polish. Combining the best elements of <strong>text-based adventures</strong>, <strong>point-and-click mechanics</strong>, and a sprinkle of <strong>RPG charm</strong>, this humorous and nostalgic journey will tickle your brain and your funny bone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452050/extras/3559b8c7b6d64baddc4de5c42f478c22.poster.avif?t=1749483535\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452050/extras/3559b8c7b6d64baddc4de5c42f478c22.webm?t=1749483535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452050/extras/3559b8c7b6d64baddc4de5c42f478c22.mp4?t=1749483535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as we know it is on the brink of catastrophe\u2014but <strong>the first domino that set everything in motion fell back in 1990</strong>. Now, you\u2019ve been thrown back in time to <strong>change history and prevent the events that led to today\u2019s downfall</strong>. As an unlikely hero navigating a world of absurd characters, bizarre puzzles, and nostalgic charm, you'll need to outsmart obstacles, <strong>roll the dice in crucial moments</strong>, and make choices that will determine the future. The fate of <strong>humanity, the universe, and even moccasins</strong> rests in your hands\u2026 or rather, your feet.</p><p clas